hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1741","###
 Muhammad bin Rafi narrated to us, Surayj bin al-Nu'man narrated to us, Fulayh narrated to us. And Ahmad bin al-Azhar narrated to us, Yunus bin Muhammad narrated to us, Fulayh narrated to us, from Sa'id bin al-Harith, from Abu Salamah, who said: I said, ""By Allah, if I were to go to Abu Sa'id and ask him about this Hour (the specific time of answered supplication on Friday), perhaps he has knowledge of it"
